@startuml
title Member C - Grounding and independent Risk Review\nMC-ACT-0.1 candidate, 2026-09-12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
skinparam activityBorderColor #27465B
skinparam ArrowColor #27465B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5D9
|A: Domain / Orchestrator|
start
:C01 Load authorised current work/input\nand accepted read-only order result;
if (Authorised and current?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject obsolete/unauthorised work;\nno change to replacement round;
  stop
endif
if (Pre-proposal order block?) then (CONFLICT / AUTHORITY_DENIED)
  :Persist actual OrderLookupBlock;\nmanual-only UC-03, no fake review;
  stop
endif
if (Order/input usable?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Correctable missing information -> Coordinator;\ntechnical error -> bounded recovery;\nno invented order or Risk outcome;
  stop
endif
|C1: Retrieval / Verification|
:C02 retrieve(RetrievalRequest)\nPreserve passages, provenance and conflicts;
note right
  NO_MATCH is a typed empty result.
  Port error is a technical error.
  Neither means Risk PASS.
end note
|A: Domain / Orchestrator|
if (Retrieval port returned valid result?) then (yes)
else (technical error)
  :Record actual RETRIEVAL failure;\nbounded recovery, no fabricated source or PASS;
  stop
endif
|A: Assessment / Orchestrator|
:C03 Draft non-executable DecisionPacket;\npreserve original statement references;
|C1: Retrieval / Verification|
:verify_citations(CitationVerificationRequest)\nCheck exact location, version and hash;
|A: Domain / Orchestrator|
if (Verification port returned valid result?) then (yes)
else (technical error)
  :Record actual-stage technical failure;\nbounded recovery, no inferred valid citations;
  stop
endif
:C04 Validate complete material and bindings;\ncheck every capacity without truncation;
if (Complete admissible bundle?) then (yes)
  :Atomically accept proposal +\nHistoricalProposalBundle + audit;
else (no)
  :No new current proposal / no partial review;\npreserve history; actual-stage typed failure;\ncapacity excess = REQUEST_TOO_LARGE, non-retryable;
  stop
endif
:Select current work/round/invocation;\nsupply accepted RiskReviewRequest;
|C2: Independent Risk Reviewer|
:C05 Separate prompt and model invocation;\ncheck support, conflict, missing evidence,\nscope, confidence, injection and authority;
note right
  Read accepted original material,
  not generator hidden reasoning.
  No proposal edit, state write,
  approval or provider capability.
end note
|A: Domain / Orchestrator|
:C06 Validate reply / current bindings\nand atomic selected invocation guard;
if (Event still selected and current?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Discard for current use; obsolete reply, timeout,\nretry or exhaustion cannot alter newer round;
  stop
endif
if (Well-formed valid business result?) then (yes)
  :Atomically store RiskReview + audit;\nretain exact proposal/input/corpus binding;
else (no / timeout)
  :Bounded technical recovery of selected invocation;\notherwise explicit failure handling;\nnever fabricate PASS or a sixth outcome;
  stop
endif
switch (RiskReview.outcome)
case (PASS / PASS_WITH_WARNING)
  :C07 Present current packet and any warnings;\nno BLOCK finding; AWAITING_APPROVAL\nonly if other Domain guards also pass;
case (REVISE)
  :C08 Route specific revision_requests;\nwithin budget -> new proposal/version and review;\nbudget exhausted -> explicit escalation, no fake outcome;
case (NEEDS_INFORMATION)
  :C09 Coordinator / UC-01E questions;\naccepted current answer -> new input/proposal;\nold review remains historical;
case (ESCALATE)
  :C10 Show BLOCK findings to Founder;\ncurrent proposal may be revised or handled manually;\nnever approve this escalated proposal;
endswitch
stop
legend bottom
One admitted analysis round. Revision/clarification schedules a separately guarded round.
Only Domain writes business state. PASS is not approval. No operation is dispatched here.
Source-policy conflict != pre-proposal OrderLookupBlock != technical ProcessingFailure.
AI-assisted refinement of the shared report discussion candidate; A/C review pending.
endlegend
@enduml
